      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the PS Management office in Madrid, Paquita and her assistant Magüi struggle to take Macarena's framed poster down from the wall. Once the frame finally comes off, Paquita quotes a classic Spanish proverb about doors opening and declares the start of their talent hunt. Listen to the Spanish first, then we'll walk through each line.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
